  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting T&#xfc;rkiye&#x2019;s Efforts for Efficient Migration Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the Presidency of Migration Management&apos;s (PMM) efforts to manage migration, particularly the effective implementation of T&#xfc;rkiye&#x2019;s Strategy Document and National Action Plan on Irregular Migration (2021-2025) and promote regular migration by strengthening cooperation and partnerships with countries of origin and destination, and countries on the same migratory routes with T&#xfc;rkiye</narrative>
  </description>
